<title>USA: Borg-Warner files for $150 mln in notes.</title>
<headline>Borg-Warner files for $150 mln in notes.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Borg-Warner Automotive Inc said Thursday it filed a registration with the Securities and Exchange Commission to sell up to $150 million in senior notes due 2006.</p>
<p>The offering will made through Merrill Lynch &amp; Co, Chase Securities Inc, Morgan Stanley &amp; Co Inc and Nationsbanc Capital Markets Inc, the filing said</p>
<p>The company will use the proceeds to reduce the amounts outstanding under the company's revolving credit system, the filing said.</p>
</text>
